[size=5]Cartur's Mining[/size]

More to the Pickaxes skill you already have: hit deposits harder, get more ore out of them, and once you're good enough, sometimes bring a whole deposit down in one blow.

Inspired by [b]Smoothbrain's Mining[/b] (deprecated in 2026) - credit to Smoothbrain for the idea. This is a separate mod, written from scratch for Valheim 1.0; it shares no code with theirs.

[size=4]What it does[/size]

Everything builds on the game's own Pickaxes skill. There is no second skill to grind.

[list]
[*][b]Any level[/b] - more pickaxe damage on ore and rock, double at 100, on top of the game's own skill bonus.
[*][b]Any level[/b] - more from every deposit - copper, silver, tin, obsidian, stone - double at 100.
[*][b]Level 50[/b] - a small chance (1 hit in 50) that a hit shatters the whole deposit at once, every chunk dropping its ore.
[/list]

[b]Ctrl + T[/b] turns shattering off and on, for when you want a deposit to last.

[size=4]Multiplayer[/size]

Install it on the server too and its numbers apply to everyone. The key stays your own.

Source: [url=https://github.com/jekkle/cartur-mining]github.com/jekkle/cartur-mining[/url]

